{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "1. Open FENblix." : {
      "comment" : "First of three steps for enabling the extension."
    },
    "2. Choose FENblix > Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Second step. FENblix > Settings is a menu item; match the name FENblix gives it."
    },
    "3. Enable Example Theme." : {
      "comment" : "Third step, in FENblix's Settings. “Example Theme” is the extension's name."
    },
    "Example Theme" : {
      "comment" : "Window heading: the name of the extension this app installs."
    },
    "FENblix Theme Example" : {
      "comment" : "Window title: the name of the app carrying Example Theme."
    },
    "FENblix extensions that are provided by other apps are disabled until they are enabled in FENblix:" : {
      "comment" : "Introduces three numbered steps."
    },
    "This app installs Example Theme, a theme extension for FENblix. It draws the board, the piece trays and the pieces. It shows how an extension is built and shipped." : {
      "comment" : "Describes the app and its extension. “Example Theme” and “FENblix” are names."
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
